  "a": "Rerun of allrows.py/owncmp.py (values identical to the 19 Oct run). 63 crosswalk weapons, rows on both builds: WB 2,771/60, GS 11,500/206, PD 567/13, 0 differing; on 2.1.1.0 alone GS 11,524 (24 added GS_M240L stance rows). Season 5: MRGGA_WB 43, CDX40_WB 55, PKM_WB 43, each GS_ 206, four bullets 13 each (141/824/52), 0 differing. No registry rows: GS_BREN3, RSAR999_WB, PD_545x39mm_MG, PD_9x39mm_Match, PD_9x39mm_Semi. 524 array-valued rows are not scalar-paired.",
